<title>GERMANY: Duesseldorf Feb passenger traffic down 7.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Duesseldorf Feb passenger traffic down 7.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Passenger traffic at Duesseldorf airport slumped 7.6 percent year-on-year to 904,540 travellers in February, the German airport association ADV said.</p>
<p>This followed a fall of 3.1 percent in January, the ADV monthly traffic report showed.</p>
<p>The following tables show 1997 passenger details with percentage changes on the same period 12 months ago.</p>
<p>    Feb 1997			Monthly total	Pct change</p>
<p>    Total				904,540	    Down 7.6</p>
<p>    Domestic			   285,760	    Down 10.0</p>
<p>    Europe			     476,688	    Down 10.7</p>
<p>    Overseas			   131,101	    Up   13.5</p>
<p>    Transit			     10,281	    Down  8.1</p>
<p>    Jan-Feb 1997		 Cumulative total    Pct change</p>
<p>    Total			    1,809,424	    Down  5.4</p>
<p>    Domestic			   563,850	    Down  7.2</p>
<p>    Europe			     955,924	    Down  8.5</p>
<p>    Overseas			   267,968	    Up   12.9</p>
<p>    Transit			     20,028	    Down  7.1</p>
<p>--Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017</p>
